# PERMISSIONS, PRIVACY AND OFFLINE
- Use the Storage Access Framework (ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT_TREE and ACTION_OPEN_DOCUMENT) with persisted URI permissions. Do NOT request MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE, READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE, or QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES.
